Delegation guard — replacing the hand-run mutation check with a real test.

test_beam_dofn_actually_delegates_to_the_shared_door stubs route_intake to return a
known-wrong answer and asserts the DoFn's output changes with it. That is only possible
if the delegation is real, so it catches a duplicate implementation that the
output-comparison test (test_beam_intake_and_router_agree_on_every_record) cannot.

REGRESSION SIMULATED: ParseAndFilterFn.process inlines its own copy of doors 1-2,
behaviourally identical to route_intake, with `except Exception: outcome =
route_intake(...)` as a fallback.

